# 🧠 The Sovereign AGI Manifesto
## _A Comprehensive Guide to Artificial General Intelligence Through Practical Hallucination_

---

## 📖 Table of Contents

1. [Core Philosophy](#core-philosophy)
2. [AGI Concepts Decoded](#agi-concepts-decoded)
